Z||000000||Pheagey||11-06-2001||08:06 AM||||   IF you've read my postest from earlier this weekend you know whats happend. If not read it here: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011549.html." TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011549.html.</A> <BR>   Now were comes some more. This morning a freind from the local coffee shop calls me at like 7am (about the time I get up) and tells me the tires are gonw! Im think "no f!@kin' way! this gatta be a joke!" So I say: your joking right?"He responds:"Im dead seriouse." I respond back:" EEEERmrmmrmrr, alright (ooobviously pissed off). thanks."<BR>   Now I have a car w/ a tore up interior, no sound system, very few tools, and no tires. Can anything go bad? Well Im ganna call my insurance and claim it stolen basicly that's what happends to it now). If they do not cover it Im screwed. Anyone have words of wisdom to offer?...<BR>(I would have cussed in this post but PEE is bleepin' it out).<P>------------------<BR>"There is no replacement for displacement.Period"<BR>    -Mr.Frosty<P>'88 coupe, 5 speed: Status: Unknown.<BR>Broken down: 3 times<BR>Broken into: 2  times (w/i 2 days)<BR>Killed: '97 Civic LX Auto,<BR>Killed by: '93 Civic EX 5 speed, <A HREF="Http://www.LithiumEffects.com/car.html" TARGET=_blank>Http://www.LithiumEffects.com/car.html</A> <P>[This message has been edited by Pheagey (edited 11-06-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Pheagey (edited 11-11-2001).]||||reg||8
