Z||000011||Pheagey||11-06-2001||01:29 PM||||   I had to ask if it could get worse didn't I? Well it has..<BR>   Went to the insurance and they told me the same s!@t again: "...you only have liability, we cann't help you sssooorrrrrryyy..."(bi**hes).<BR>   I get back to work planning to call the police and pull the tags when a tow truck drivers comes in and say's he has it on the back of his truck. Damn, now I gatta borrow $135 from my bossand pay him back on Firday when I get payed. He (my boss) is being very kind and letting me leave my car where I work till I get tires (a $20 set of donuts will have to work till I have the money).<BR>   So I dunno what Im ganna do now. I had my insurance cancalled till I figure it out so that'll save me a 100 a month till I stat driving again.<BR>   Ok, now that its this bad whats left?...<P>(I was ganna report it stolen but the highway mantance ppl had already spotted it back on sunday when I was there ( they pulled over and offerd help).<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Pheagey (edited 11-11-2001).]||||reg||8
